<title>USA: NHL ICE HOCKEY-SUNDAY'S STANLEY CUP PLAYOFF RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NHL ICE HOCKEY-SUNDAY'S STANLEY CUP PLAYOFF RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of first-round</p>
<p>National Hockey League Stanley Cup playoff games on Sunday</p>
<p>(home team in CAPS):</p>
<p>		   EASTERN CONFERENCE</p>
<p> Detroit	     3  ST LOUIS		 1</p>
<p>(Detroit wins best-of-seven series 4-2)</p>
<p> Buffalo	    at  OTTAWA</p>
<p>(Ottawa leads best-of-seven series 3-2)</p>
<p>		   WESTERN CONFERENCE</p>
<p> Dallas	     3  EDMONTON		 2</p>
<p>	  (best-of-seven series tied 3-3)</p>
<p> Anaheim	    3  PHOENIX		  2 (OT)</p>
<p>	  (best-of-seven series tied 3-3)</p>
</text>
